@startuml
title EcoTrack Platform - Backend Bounded Contexts
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle

class "IAM" as BackendIAM <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Organization Management" as BackendOrgMgmt <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Emissions Management" as BackendEmissions <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Carbon Footprint Calculation" as BackendFootprint <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Goals and Reduction Plans" as BackendGoals <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Analytics and Reports" as BackendAnalytics <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Data Integration" as BackendDataIntegration <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Shared Kernel" as BackendSharedKernel <<Bounded Context>> {}
class "Integration Events" as BackendIntegrationEvents <<Pattern>> {}

BackendOrgMgmt ..> BackendIAM : user scope
BackendEmissions ..> BackendOrgMgmt : facility scope
BackendFootprint ..> BackendEmissions : activity data
BackendGoals ..> BackendFootprint : footprint results
BackendDataIntegration ..> BackendEmissions : imported data
BackendAnalytics ..> BackendOrgMgmt : organization metrics
BackendAnalytics ..> BackendEmissions : emissions metrics
BackendAnalytics ..> BackendFootprint : footprint metrics
BackendAnalytics ..> BackendGoals : goals metrics

BackendIAM ..> BackendIntegrationEvents : UserRegistered
BackendOrgMgmt ..> BackendIntegrationEvents : OrganizationRegistered / FacilityRegistered
BackendEmissions ..> BackendIntegrationEvents : EmissionSourceRegistered / ActivityDataRecorded
BackendFootprint ..> BackendIntegrationEvents : FootprintCalculated
BackendGoals ..> BackendIntegrationEvents : GoalCreated / PlanCreated / InitiativeCreated
BackendDataIntegration ..> BackendIntegrationEvents : CsvImported / ExternalDataReceived
BackendIntegrationEvents ..> BackendAnalytics : RecordAnalyticsEventCommand

BackendIAM ..> BackendSharedKernel : shared value objects
BackendOrgMgmt ..> BackendSharedKernel : shared value objects
BackendEmissions ..> BackendSharedKernel : shared value objects
BackendFootprint ..> BackendSharedKernel : shared value objects
BackendGoals ..> BackendSharedKernel : shared value objects
BackendAnalytics ..> BackendSharedKernel : shared value objects
BackendDataIntegration ..> BackendSharedKernel : shared value objects

@enduml
